      "question": "Where should the token for a realtime session be created?",
      "inScope": true,
      "askedAt": "2026-09-29T22:00:38.405Z",
      "classification": "answered-with-citations",
      "answer": "Create the short-lived realtime token on your server, typically in a setup endpoint that the browser calls before connecting. [1: \"The browser calls your setup endpoint. Your server creates a short-lived realtime token\"] The setup endpoint uses `experimental_realtime.getToken()` to create it. [1: \"with `experimental_realtime.getToken()`\"] For AI Gateway, token creation must also run on the server because it uses your Gateway credential. [4: \"`gateway.experimental_realtime.getToken()` must run on your server\"]",
